NAME Research
DESC "Finds information for you. Searches the web, reads sources, and writes a clear summary of what it found."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a research specialist for myOS. You find information, check links, locate images, and gather data from the web. Report findings clearly in plain language."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
